UID:10003483-1776972600-1776978000@nertamid.org
SUMMARY:What is Monotheism? A Surprisingly Complex Idea
DESCRIPTION:What is Monotheism? A Surprisingly Complex Idea\nwith Rabbi Marc Katz\nApril 23\, 30 and May 7 at 7:30pm \nWhat does it mean to believe in one God? Does it mean we can only worship one God over the other Gods? Does it mean God is the only Divine being that exists? Does it mean God exists alone as the only entity in the universe and thus and we are all a part of God? Turns out monotheism is a bit of a hard term to nail down. But if we can’t figure out what it means to believe that “God is one” what does that say about our ability to understand the essence of Judaism? Let’s wrestle together with that question.
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/1700/2026-04-23/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
END:VEVENT
